.TH evince-rs\-thumbnailer 1 2007\-01\-15
.SH NAME
evince-rs\-thumbnailer \- create png thumbnails from PostScript and PDF documents
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBevince\-rs\-thumbnailer\fR [\-s \fBsize\fR] \fBinput\fR \fBoutput\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
evince-rs\-thumbnailer is a program to
create thumbnails from PostScript (PS), Portable Document Format
(PDF), DjVu and DVI files.
.SH OPTIONS
evince-rs obeys all normal GTK
command line options. The only option \-s \fIsize
\fRmakes it possible to choose the vertical size
of the created thumbnail.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBevince\-rs\fR(1),
\fBgnome\-options\fR(7),
\fBgtk\-options\fR(7).
.PP
http://www.gnome.org/projects/evince-rs/
